{{Classic Era}}
 ...for knowledge is the greatest quest of all.
 - Erud, Father of Erudites, Founder of Erudin.

[[File:Erudin-library.jpg|666px|right]]Erud was a legendary [[Erudite]] (or perhaps a [[Human]], or some sort of ancestor to both races) who sailed from [[Qeynos]] to the continent of [[Odus]] and founded the city of [[Erudin]]. [[Erudite]]s' [[Human]] heritage and the value of seeking knowledge follow from his example.


